      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">EnLink Midstream, LLC also owns all outstanding common units of EnLink Midstream Partners, LP. EnLink Midstream, LLC also owns 99.999% limited partner interest and 0.001% general partner interest in EnLink Midstream Operating, LP, which in turn owns 100% limited partner interest in the respondent.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-2" id="fn-2" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">Because EnLink Midstream, LLC is taxed as a corporation we have updated the composite tax rate for the period reported December 31, 2020.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
  </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrli:xbrl>
